── where this hub does NOT live ───────────────────────────────
Not !CLOUD. _SRV/WHOAMI is explicit: instances live at
!CLOUD/<NAME>/ with <NAME>.me · policy.kdl · ledger.gensL, and
that family is storage/infra guarded by srv-snap (CITADEL is a
ZFS pool). A bot registry is station config, and TPR already
has a station — so the hub sits beside it, in Telegram/.
:: ∎
